# 3. HYBRID AUTONOMY MODEL

## 3.1 Decision Model

| Layer       | Mode                                |
| ----------- | ----------------------------------- |
| JARVIS      | deterministic routing + enforcement |
| AYRE        | probabilistic expansion suggestions |
| GOD SYSTEMS | rule-based transformation           |
| MCP         | compilation + reduction             |
| SKADI       | execution only                      |

---

## 3.2 HYBRID CONTROL RULE

All decisions must pass through:

> **Binary Gate + Threshold Warning System**

### AEGIS behavior (P-002 alignment)

* NOT hard-block everything
* instead:

  * PASS → execute
  * WARN → log + continue
  * HOLD → escalate to JARVIS

This prevents:

* over-blocking
* recursive halting
* connector deadlocks

