# 7. ANTI-RECURSION GUARANTEE

## Forbidden patterns:

* MCP calling GOD SYSTEMS recursively
* SKADI triggering ODIN again
* AYRE writing directly to memory
* JARVIS calling connectors directly

## Hard rule:

> Each layer executes ONCE per transaction cycle.

---

# 8. SYSTEM BLOAT CONTROL (GL7 ENFORCEMENT)

Any new:

* tool
* connector
* god system function

MUST satisfy:

```
reduces_complexity == true
overlap_score < 0.40
```

Otherwise:
→ rejected or merged into existing system

